# pcsdisk.ps2 - SAVE and LOAD at the editor (`pcs 23 N demo2l.pbt`, a table
# with a free-hand layer): a part added and a line drawn, the table SAVEd,
# parts deleted and SAVEd again over the same name - a shorter file, so the
# old one must have been deleted first - a different table picked off the
# catalogue and LOADed, a LOAD of a name that is not there REFUSED, and the
# saved table LOADed back (pcsdisk.inc).
#
# ⚠ Card pixels.  DISK is the tool column's icon at (564, 276); the name
# field is (332, 16, 192, 24), the catalogue's rows are 16 high from y 56,
# LOAD / SAVE / QUIT are 60 x 24 at x 332 / 398 / 464, y 296, and MORE is
# below LOAD at y 328.  checkpcs.py `ui-disk` models every gesture and key
# from these points, through pcsdisk.py.
origin 0 0
gap 300

# 1  a part out of the first bin, let go on the table at world (60, 200)
at 1.000    move to 348 70
+0.300      down left
+0.300      move to 200 330
+0.300      move to 120 400
+0.400      up left

# 2  MAGN, a line of fat bits into the layer, QUIT
at 6.000    move to 564 190
+0.300      click left
at 10.000   move to 352 60
+0.300      down left
+0.300      move to 420 160
+0.400      up left
at 14.000   move to 368 380
+0.300      click left

# 3  DISK, the name, SAVE
at 19.000   move to 564 276
+0.300      click left
at 23.000   type "mytbl"
at 26.000   move to 428 308
+0.300      click left

# 4  QUIT, and two parts dragged off the table: the one just added, and
#    demo2's object 1
at 31.000   move to 494 308
+0.300      click left
at 35.000   move to 124 404
+0.300      down left
+0.300      move to 300 404
+0.300      move to 400 404
+0.400      up left
at 40.000   move to 214 320
+0.300      down left
+0.300      move to 300 320
+0.300      move to 400 320
+0.400      up left

# 5  DISK again, and SAVE over the same name: a shorter file
at 45.000   move to 564 276
+0.300      click left
at 49.000   move to 428 308
+0.300      click left

# 6  demo1, picked off the catalogue's first row, and LOADed
at 54.000   move to 400 64
+0.300      click left
at 57.000   move to 362 308
+0.300      click left

# 7  a name that is not on the card: REFUSED, and demo1 stays
at 63.000   key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
at 66.000   type "nosuch"
at 69.000   move to 362 308
+0.300      click left

# 8  and the saved table back
at 73.000   key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
+0.300      key tap backspace
at 76.000   type "mytbl"
at 79.000   move to 362 308
+0.300      click left

# 9  MORE (one page: it wraps), QUIT, and the editor ends
at 85.000   move to 362 340
+0.300      click left
at 88.000   move to 494 308
+0.300      click left
at 92.000   type "q"
